<h3 data-start="267" data-end="307">3. Demand vs Salary — Optimal Skills</h3>
<p data-start="309" data-end="480">This one is <strong data-start="321" data-end="382">probably the most valuable visualization for your project</strong>, because it shows the trade-off between how frequently a skill is requested and how much it pays.</p>
